      - mark 3 A 11
      - mark 3 B 17
      - mark 3 C 22
      - mark 3 D 23
      - mark 3 E 24
      - mark 3 F 29
    focus: [3,17]
    acts: ['$build']
    text: |
      {[ht,$steps]ActiveRunner Flow}

      TODO: Read {[cd]ActiveRunnerP} as a compact command-line-style benchmark program.

      {[bm,A]} TODO: The iteration count stays configurable and deliberately small for the tour.

      {[bm,B]} TODO: Startup prepares the shared {[cd]CoreBench} engine.

      {[bm,C]} TODO: LED winks bracket the active benchmark interval.

      {[bm,D]} TODO: The microsecond counter measures elapsed active time.

      {[bm,E]} TODO: The loop repeatedly calls {[cd]CoreBench.run(0)}.

      {[bm,F]} TODO: The final block prints timing and CRC validation results.

